Laura Ingram is just furious that more people
haven't died from Corona virus, and we knew

00:00:06.959 --> 00:00:08.500
that this would start happening.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:11.629
I just didn't think it would happen so quickly.

00:00:11.629 --> 00:00:15.290
This is a version of what I called the anti-vax
or conundrum.

00:00:15.290 --> 00:00:21.119
I'm not saying Laura Ingram is an anti vaccine,
but this is the anti-vax or conundrum and

00:00:21.119 --> 00:00:25.050
falling for it or deliberately perpetuating
it depends on your view.

00:00:25.050 --> 00:00:27.530
But this is what Laura Ingram is doing on
her show.

00:00:27.530 --> 00:00:34.950
She is putting out this fury, this anger that
in the end fewer people are going to die from

00:00:34.950 --> 00:00:36.400
Corona virus.

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:41.270
Then the number that might have died had we
not taken it seriously.

00:00:41.270 --> 00:00:45.780
Let's watch the clip and then I'll explain
what I mean by the anti-vaccine conundrum.

00:00:45.780 --> 00:00:52.780
And by the way, another cost of these lame
panic inducing models, it looks like we really

00:00:52.780 --> 00:00:59.960
