00:01:08.130 --> 00:01:09.130
amazing.

00:01:09.130 --> 00:01:11.320
The commanders, amazing.

00:01:11.320 --> 00:01:19.530
But this is a lot of money that we're spending
on a response that was based again on faulty

00:01:19.530 --> 00:01:20.530
numbers.

00:01:20.530 --> 00:01:26.859
Now, long before the government figured out
